    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stele is a challenging and intelligent puzzle game filled with problem-solving and decryption.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features four chapters, encompassing a total of 96 meticulously crafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level tests players' logical thinking and strategic planning abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to utilize movable stone pillars and plan their routes to trigger a series of events,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >paving the way for small squares to reach their destinations smoothly. However,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you must consider the element of &quot;timing&quot; as setting complicated routes will consume more time,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but sometimes it becomes a necessary means to clear the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes various mechanisms, and triggering them can introduce multiple possibilities,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >leading to unexpected ways to complete the level.</p>",
